# The repo lives on a Windows mount but is edited from WSL. Without this, every
# file round-trips CRLF<->LF and a one-line change shows up as a 15,000-line diff.
# Text files are normalized to LF in the index; checkout follows the platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
